# Personal Claude Code config. The hook script itself is checked in — on its own
# it does nothing, since a script only runs once something wires it to an event —
# but the settings file that arms it is not, so cloning this repo never turns on
# an auto-push to whatever origin the clone happens to point at.
.claude/settings.local.json
